{"suttaId":"an7.83","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-vii","vriCode":"s0403m3.mul","paras":[724,725],"vripara":"83"},"segments":{"an7.83:0.3":"Satthusāsanasuttaṃ","an7.83:1.1":"Atha kho āyasmā upāli yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho āyasmā upāli bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","an7.83:2.1":"“Sādhu me, bhante, bhagavā saṃkhittena dhammaṃ desetu, yamahaṃ bhagavato dhammaṃ sutvā eko vūpakaṭṭho appamatto ātāpī pahitatto vihareyyan”ti.","an7.83:2.2":"“Ye kho tvaṃ, upāli, dhamme jāneyyāsi –","an7.83:2.3":"‘ime dhammā na ekantanibbidāya virāgāya nirodhāya upasamāya abhiññāya sambodhāya nibbānāya saṃvattantī’ti;","an7.83:2.4":"ekaṃsena, upāli, dhāreyyāsi –","an7.83:2.5":"‘neso dhammo neso vinayo netaṃ satthusāsanan’ti.","an7.83:2.6":"Ye ca kho tvaṃ, upāli, dhamme jāneyyāsi –","an7.83:2.7":"‘ime dhammā ekantanibbidāya virāgāya nirodhāya upasamāya abhiññāya sambodhāya nibbānāya saṃvattantī’ti;","an7.83:2.8":"ekaṃsena, upāli, dhāreyyāsi –","an7.83:2.9":"‘eso dhammo eso vinayo etaṃ satthusāsanan’”ti.","an7.83:2.10":"Navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-vii","bookName":"Sattakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":979,"to":979,"paras":[{"para":979,"vripara":"83","refs":["an7.83:2"],"lines":["Navame <b>eko</b>ti adutiyo.","<b>Vūpakaṭṭho</b>ti kāyena gaṇato, cittena kilesehi vūpakaṭṭho vivekaṭṭho dūrībhūto.","<b>Appamatto</b>ti satiavippavāse ṭhito.","<b>Pahitatto</b>ti pesitatto.","<b>Nibbidāyā</b>ti vaṭṭe ukkaṇṭhanatthāya.","<b>Virāgāyā</b>ti rāgādīnaṃ virajjanatthāya.","<b>Nirodhāyā</b>ti appavattikaraṇatthāya.","<b>Vūpasamāyā</b>ti kilesavūpasamāya appavattiyā.","<b>Abhiññāyā</b>ti tilakkhaṇaṃ āropetvā abhijānanatthāya.","<b>Sambodhāyā</b>ti maggasaṅkhātassa sambodhassa atthāya.","<b>Nibbānāyā</b>ti nibbānassa sacchikaraṇatthāya."],"lineRefs":[["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"],["an7.83:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an7.83:2.1","eko",0,0],["an7.83:2.1","vūpakaṭṭho",0,1],["an7.83:2.1","appamatto",0,2],["an7.83:2.1","pahitatto",0,3],["an7.83:2.3","nibbidāyā",0,4],["an7.83:2.7","nibbidāyā",0,4],["an7.83:2.3","virāgāyā",0,5],["an7.83:2.7","virāgāyā",0,5],["an7.83:2.3","nirodhāyā",0,6],["an7.83:2.7","nirodhāyā",0,6],["an7.83:2.3","abhiññāyā",0,8],["an7.83:2.7","abhiññāyā",0,8],["an7.83:2.3","sambodhāyā",0,9],["an7.83:2.7","sambodhāyā",0,9],["an7.83:2.3","nibbānāyā",0,10],["an7.83:2.7","nibbānāyā",0,10]]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-vii","bookName":"Sattakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":1011,"to":1013,"paras":[{"para":1011,"vripara":"83","refs":["an7.83:1"],"lines":["Navame <b>vivekaṭṭho</b>ti vivitto.","Tenāha <b>“dūrībhūto”</b>ti.","<b>Satiavippavāse ṭhito</b>ti kammaṭṭhāne satiṃ avijahitvā ṭhito.","<b>Pesitatto</b>ti kāye ca jīvite ca anapekkhatāya nibbānaṃ pesitacitto tanninno tappoṇo tappabbhāro."],"lineRefs":[["an7.83:1"],["an7.83:1"],["an7.83:1"],["an7.83:1"]]},{"para":1012,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Satthusāsanasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1013,"vripara":null,"refs":["an7.83:1"],"lines":["Adhikaraṇasamathasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an7.83:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]}}
